# Village lesson: the hostess asks for firewood and says where the woodpile is.
msgid "VILLAGE_LESSON_HOST_JOB"
msgstr "Need a place to sleep? Bring some firewood. The woodpile is by the workshop: follow the street past the well, the workshop is on your left. Do that, and you can spend the night by the hearth."

# Village lesson: the hostess repeats the way to the woodpile.
msgid "VILLAGE_LESSON_HOST_REMIND"
msgstr "The woodpile is by the workshop: along the street past the well, on your left."

# Village lesson: the hostess thanks the hero and sends them to the watchman at the tower.
msgid "VILLAGE_LESSON_HOST_REWARD"
msgstr "Thank you. You have a place for tonight. Before you head out on the road, find the watchman. He keeps the watchtower at the far end of the street, past the workshop. He will show you how to defend yourself."

# Village lesson: the hostess already has the firewood and repeats the way to the watchman.
msgid "VILLAGE_LESSON_HOST_ACCEPTED"
msgstr "I already have the firewood. The watchman is at the tower at the far end of the street."

# Village lesson: the hostess after the lesson.
msgid "VILLAGE_LESSON_HOST_AFTER"
msgstr "Your place by the hearth is ready. Have a look around the village."

# Village lesson: the hero takes the firewood.
msgid "VILLAGE_LESSON_WOOD_TAKEN"
msgstr "You picked up a bundle of dry firewood. Bring it back to the hostess at the first house."

# Village lesson: the woodpile before the hostess gives the job.
msgid "VILLAGE_LESSON_WOOD_BEFORE"
msgstr "Talk to the hostess at the first house first."

# Village lesson: the watchman before the hostess sends the hero.
msgid "VILLAGE_LESSON_GUARD_OTHER"
msgstr "I keep watch over the road. Looking for a place to sleep? The hostess is at the first house, down the street past the well."

# Village lesson: the watchman after the lesson points to the road to the forest inn.
msgid "VILLAGE_LESSON_GUARD_AFTER"
msgstr "The village is open, have a look around. The road past the tower leads to the forest inn."

# Village lesson objective: fetch firewood by the workshop.
msgid "VILLAGE_LESSON_OBJECTIVE_FETCH_WOOD"
msgstr "Fetch firewood from the woodpile by the workshop."

# Village lesson objective: bring the firewood back.
msgid "VILLAGE_LESSON_OBJECTIVE_RETURN_WOOD"
msgstr "Bring the firewood to the hostess at the first house."

# Village lesson objective: find the watchman at the tower.
msgid "VILLAGE_LESSON_OBJECTIVE_MEET_GUARD"
msgstr "Find the watchman at the watchtower at the far end of the street."

# Village lesson objective: done.
msgid "VILLAGE_LESSON_OBJECTIVE_DONE"
msgstr "You are settled for today. Explore the village; the road past the tower leads to the forest inn."

